python -m ruff check wavebit/_core/conforming/__init__.py tests/test_conforming_lattice_rebasing.py
All checks passed. git diff --check: passed.

Scope: right-handed bases whose integer reduction is orthogonal. This
includes integer shears and mixed integer basis changes of rectangular
point lattices. It does not implement genuinely nonorthogonal correctors,
sheared physical rectangles, curved shapes, nonpositive real materials or
automatic projector selection, and does not certify optical convergence.
